---

import Layout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import gatoGIT from '../assets/images/gatoGIT.png';

---

<Layout>

<div class="text-center mb-8 sm:mb-3 pt-12"> 
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-2 font-italiana">
        Sobre Mí
    </h1> 
</div>


<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-gray-300">

  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

    <!-- Imagen / Perfil -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="relative bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-2 border border-gray-700">
        <img 
          src={gatoGIT.src} 
          alt="Juan Dominid Muñoz Eslava" 
          class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-xl"
        />

        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur rounded-lg p-3">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-green-400 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
            <span class="text-white font-medium text-sm">Disposición inmediata</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400">3+</div>
          <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Años programando</div>
          <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">Desde 2022</div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-400">10+</div>
          <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Proyectos</div>
          <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">Académicos y profesionales</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Contacto -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-700 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Contacto</h3>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
          <span class="text-gray-400">📧</span>
          <a href="mailto:dominidzero@gmail.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">
            dominidzero@gmail.com
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
          <span class="text-gray-400">📱</span>
          <span class="text-gray-300">(+51) 975 852 932</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Texto -->
    <div class="space-y-8">

      <div class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Soy <span class="text-white font-semibold">Juan Dominid Muñoz Eslava</span>, estudiante del noveno ciclo de 
        <span class="text-blue-400">Ingeniería de Sistemas Computacionales</span> en la Universidad Privada del Norte, 
        orientado a proyectos tecnológicos y <span class="text-green-400">desarrollo de software full-stack</span>.
      </div>

      <div class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        Me especializo en desarrollo <b class="text-white">backend y frontend</b>, con experiencia en implementación 
        de APIs REST, automatización de procesos y diseño de interfaces responsivas. Mi trabajo se centra en 
        <b class="text-white">Spring Boot, Node.js/Express, React y Angular</b>, aplicando principios de 
        arquitectura limpia y Diseño Guiado por el Dominio (DDD).
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Stack Tecnológico</h3>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-2">Backend</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Java</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Spring Boot</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Node.js</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">C#</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Python</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-2">Frontend</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">React</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Angular</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Astro</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">TypeScript</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-2">Bases de Datos</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">MySQL</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">MongoDB</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">SQL Server</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-2">Otras Tecnologías</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">GraphQL</span>
                            <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Figma</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Azure</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">Git/GitHub</span>
              <span class="bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm border border-gray-700">IoT (Arduino, Raspberry Pi)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4 text-gray-400 italic">
        "Busco ampliar y perfeccionar mis habilidades técnicas y blandas, aportando al crecimiento de la empresa y fortaleciendo mi desarrollo profesional."
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</section>

</Layout>